    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110333" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμᾰκ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
		fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμακεύς,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sorceress, witch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				577a13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i> R.<i><span class="en">
				4.53
			</span></i>:— as Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνὴ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					749
				</span></i>
			; irreg. 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμακιστόταται γυναικῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					17.4.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μήδεια.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> fem. Adj.,
				<i>poisonous, venomous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαύρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					538
				</span></i>
			.</div>
